# Wireshark captures: large + reproducible → excluded from git (WSL/NTFS corruption risk, no remote).
# Reference bytes (golden frames) are pinned in docs/dcp-golden-frames.md and in the tests.
*.pcapng
*.pcap
!.gitignore
# GSDML of the p-net sample app (rt-labs, GPLv3 repo): test-bench input only, not ours to redistribute.
GSDML-*.xml
# Plan 7 campaign outputs (logs, CSV, 100 MB pcap): local only, summarized in docs/bench-pnet-device.md §6e/§6f.
plan7-*/
plan6-*/
robustness-*/
